# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MT5-BRIDGE BACKEND ENV  (EXAMPLE — copy to .env and fill in)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database ───
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/dbname

# ─── Auth ───
JWT_SECRET=change-me

# ─── PAYMENTS — feature flag ───
PAYMENTS_ENABLED=false
PAYMENTS_SIMULATE=false

# ─── PayWave Xpress (STK push) ───
PAYWAVE_API_KEY=
PAYWAVE_EMAIL=
PAYWAVE_BASE_URL=https://api.paywave.co.ke

# ─── M-Pesa (manual fallback) ───
MPESA_TILL=
MPESA_BUSINESS_NAME=PipTrader AI
MPESA_ACCOUNT_NAME=
MPESA_CALLBACK_URL=https://your-domain.com/v1/payments/mpesa/callback

# ─── Binance USDT TRC20 (manual) ───
BINANCE_ID=
BINANCE_WALLET_ADDRESS=
BINANCE_WALLET_PROVIDER=
BINANCE_NETWORK=USDT (TRC20)
BINANCE_MIN_DEPOSIT=10 USDT

# ─── Exchange rate ───
USD_TO_KES_RATE=129
